<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata"><head><metadata xmlns=""><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/></metadata></head><body dur="00:30.000"><div xmlns=""><p begin="00:00.100" end="00:05.000" itunes:key="L1" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="00:00.100" end="00:02.500">短行</span> <span begin="00:02.600" end="00:05.000">不断行</span></p><p begin="00:05.100" end="00:12.000" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="00:05.100" end="00:12.000">这是一条特别长的歌词行用来验证LineBalancer均衡断行算法的移植是否正确它能把很长很长的中文歌词均匀地切成视觉长度接近的多行而不是让最后一行只剩一两个字</span></p><p begin="00:12.100" end="00:19.000" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="00:12.100" end="00:19.000">And this is a very long english lyric line with multiple words to verify the space preferred balanced breaking behavior works as expected here</span></p><p begin="00:19.100" end="00:26.000" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="00:19.100" end="00:26.000">这条翻译文本同样故意写得特别长长到必须发生贪婪断行才能完整显示在窗口里面而不会溢出到右边界之外</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这一条是刻意超长的翻译子行文本用来验证翻译行的贪婪断行是否按预期工作它应该自动折到第二行显示而不会横向溢出窗口边界</span></p><p begin="00:26.100" end="00:30.000" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="00:26.100" end="00:30.000">主行带伴唱</span><span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="00:26.100" end="00:28.000">(背景人声第一句)</span> <span begin="00:28.000" end="00:30.000">(背景人声第二句)</span></span></p></div></body></tt>
